<title>USA: Fidelity waives fee on SIMPLE-IRA product.</title>
<headline>Fidelity waives fee on SIMPLE-IRA product.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments said it willl waive maintenance fees for 1997 for its new SIMPLE-IRA retirement savings product for small businesses.</p>
<p>The product, designed for businesses with fewer than 100 employees, includes a variety of investment options including 10 of Fidelity's no-load mutual funds and mutual funds from other companies.</p>
<p>-- Boston bureau (617) 367-4106</p>
</text>
